[ system ]
{# Partly based on SkyrimNet's prompts/memory/generate_memory.prompt (its role line, the response
   format and the lists of emotions and memory types), modified and distributed for use with
   SkyrimNet under section 3 (Content packs) of the SkyrimNet Game Plugin License.
